<title>POLAND: POLL-Polish 3-month WIBOR seen at 20.96 end-97.</title>
<headline>POLL-Polish 3-month WIBOR seen at 20.96 end-97.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Warsaw Interbank Offered Rate (WIBOR) for three-month deposits is expected to ease to 20.96 percent by the end of the year from 23.03 percent on Thursday, a Reuter poll of Poland's 25 biggest banks showed.</p>
<p>		JULY	   END-97	  12-MONTHS AHEAD</p>
<p>WIBOR AVG  22.83	20.96 (19.63)	19.23 (18.32)</p>
<p>MINIMUM    22.20	16.00 (17.00)	14.50 (15.40)</p>
<p>MAXIMUM    23.25	23.20 (21.95)	22.50 (21.00)</p>
<p>NOTE: In brackets previous figures for end-97 and June-98 from</p>
<p>last month's poll.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
